      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING NICK (8) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Grade 4 at Q Straight. Better than latest and can atone here. THAI MYSTIQUE (2) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when third (19.99) in a Mix 5 at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. MY CUJO (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (20.32) in a Mix 5 at this track. The form from his last run stacks up well. Should be about the money. MOJO BONE (7) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when third (25.63) in a Grade 4/5 over 457m at this track.",
